WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Thanks to Xianjia for the help

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:04,080
Lan Wuchang left my grandson alive

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,240
I will bury the snake well

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:10,050
If the fairy family needs anything, you can let me know in your dream.

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,900
Dad, what's going on in this dark business?

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,820
He is here to save our baby

7
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,980
Stop talking nonsense and bury the snake quickly.

8
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,740
Dad, how many times do you have to go to this hospital? Don't be too tired.

9
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,820
I dragged him to the back of the mountain and buried him in the pit.

10
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:26,190
Don't leave a mark

11
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:29,320
I have a fever. Come with me to the county seat.

12
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,750
Immediately after I was born, I was targeted by Impermanence.

13
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:35,280
I'm afraid this baby's life is light.

14
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,560
Impermanence dictates

15
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,560
Fairy lives

16
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,680
frail and sickly

17
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,080
light fortune

18
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,400
Can a big girl see what's wrong with this kid and can she fix it?

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,600
Any amount is fine

20
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,680
The boy married a famous girl named Zhou and named Tianshun.

21
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:47,600
Change your name

22
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,760
One name and one iron

23
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:50,680
Iron Rat Yangjin, this baby has a light character

24
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,600
auspicious sound

25
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,880
Just suppress this kid

26
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:57,740
I can take over your job

27
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:59,020
People are gone

28
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,270
Am I hallucinating?

29
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:05,900
Thanks for the immortal’s advice and not hitting Xiaotie

30
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,020
Grandpa goes to the county to deliver goods

31
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:08,020
Come back and bring you toys

32
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,500
Be obedient at home and don't run around

33
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:11,060
Grandpa will be back before dark

34
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,780
Grandpa, I want a car

35
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:14,060
What did you do?

36
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:15,260
I went to the county town to find work

37
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:19,170
You always say that I lie down every day and do nothing, Zhou Jie

38
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:23,860
Don't think me

39
00:01:23,860 --> 00:01:24,900
Dad is gone

40
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:26,420
Mom is gone too

41
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:29,130
It hurts to be the only one left again

42
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:30,090
this feeling

43
00:01:30,090 --> 00:01:34,300
It's like someone's got into my heart, mom

44
00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:35,820
Are you back? Mom
